{"law":"嘉義市-GL000779","name":"嘉義市迅行及策略性更新地區建築物高度及建蔽率放寬標準","region":"嘉義市","source":"https://law.chiayi.gov.tw/LawContentHistoryList.aspx?id=GL000779","note":"歷次版本取自該縣市法規系統「歷史法規」；promulgated 是異動（發布）日期。施行日：自治法規依地方制度法第 32 條為發布日起算第三日，條文定有日期者依其日期；行政規則（要點、原則等）未明定者不推定（effectiveKnown=false）。無法切分條號的舊版只存 fullText。","currentPromulgated":null,"currentHash":"5b4893fed68ecf682a53264636f1d9d33398ceb98ca70ffffad6a6ddef38fca2","texts":{"6ad55d4aff612457":"本標準依都市更新條例(以下簡稱本條例)第六十五條第四項規定\n\n       訂定之。","f47959291fbe5631":"本標準之主管機關為嘉義市政府。","9f15d32d94e79614":"本標準適用範圍為依本條例第七條、第八條劃定或變更之迅行及\n\n       策略性更新地區。","68870dd1ae268636":"更新單元放寬建蔽率，土地使用分區以住宅區為限，且不得超過\n\n       原建蔽率。","f4bcd240dd437f76":"更新單元之建築物高度，除飛航安全管制及軍事管制外，不受建\n\n       築法令及都市計畫法令之建築高度限制。","0760487a7e1a3f98":"本標準自發布日施行。"},"versions":[{"promulgated":null,"url":"https://law.chiayi.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=GL000779","effective":null,"effectiveKnown":false,"effectiveBasis":"無發布日期","exceptions":{},"current":true,"changed":{"第一條":"6ad55d4aff612457","第二條":"f47959291fbe5631","第三條":"9f15d32d94e79614","第四條":"68870dd1ae268636","第五條":"f4bcd240dd437f76","第六條":"0760487a7e1a3f98"},"removed":[],"articleOrder":["第一條","第二條","第三條","第四條","第五條","第六條"],"articleCount":6}],"articles":{"第一條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"6ad55d4aff612457","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第二條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"f47959291fbe5631","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第三條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"9f15d32d94e79614","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第四條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"68870dd1ae268636","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第五條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"f4bcd240dd437f76","version":null,"promulgated":null}],"第六條":[{"from":null,"fromKnown":false,"to":null,"toKnown":true,"text":"0760487a7e1a3f98","version":null,"promulgated":null}]}}
